{"id":"76fae203d87d09fc","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-epsilon-0-ti.md","title":"Epsilon 0 Transfinite Induction","display":"thm-epsilon-0-ti — Epsilon 0 Transfinite Induction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-epsilon-0-ti","aliases":["72-thm-epsilon-0-ti"],"display":"thm-epsilon-0-ti — Epsilon 0 Transfinite Induction","depends_on":["[[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]","[[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]","[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §2.1.3, print238–240/PDF250–252","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"source-statement-checked; induction construction not fully reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-epsilon-0-ti"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-epsilon-0-ti</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-epsilon-0-ti — Epsilon 0 Transfinite Induction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"069c67d72b4fb710\" href=\"?note=069c67d72b4fb710\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0-notation\">72-df-epsilon-0-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cc4e14a96f221dc\" href=\"?note=9cc4e14a96f221dc\" title=\"72-df-recursive-order-presentation\">72-df-recursive-order-presentation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §2.1.3, print238–240/PDF250–252"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-statement-checked; induction construction not fully reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"069c67d72b4fb710\" href=\"?note=069c67d72b4fb710\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0-notation\">72-df-epsilon-0-notation</a> 的PR程序表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_\\varepsilon\">\\(e_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{&lt;a}\">\\(e_{&lt;a}\\)</span> 取同一节点 Assertion 中的显式程序对，不按外延相等自行更换程序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TI}_{e_{&lt;a}}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{TI}_{e_{&lt;a}}(A)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9cc4e14a96f221dc\" href=\"?note=9cc4e14a96f221dc\" title=\"72-df-recursive-order-presentation\">72-df-recursive-order-presentation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 遍历PR算术语言中无集量词的公式，可含自由集参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是集变量。下式对a和A的量化均为元语言量化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NT}\">\\(\\mathsf{NT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\rm PR}\">\\(E_{\\rm PR}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(2)}(\\mathsf{NT})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(2)}(\\mathsf{NT})\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a>，它是元命题，不是对象语言的Con句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_{\\rm PR})\\quad\\mathsf{NT}\\vdash_2\\operatorname{ucl}(\\operatorname{TI}_{e_{&lt;a}}(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_{\\rm PR})\\quad\\mathsf{NT}\\vdash_2\\operatorname{ucl}(\\operatorname{TI}_{e_{&lt;a}}(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(2)}(\\mathsf{NT})\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{NT}\\nvdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_{e_\\varepsilon}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(2)}(\\mathsf{NT})\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{NT}\\nvdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_{e_\\varepsilon}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个固定初段的归纳可证性见本书IV§2.1.3。对带集参数公式可用对谓词实例的同一归纳证明；不含集参数时得到PA的相应模式。统一TI_eε(X)不可证需要一致性及能在NT中形式化Gentzen归约；见源定理。原文“PA⊬WF”若WF含集量词而PA语言无集变量，属于类型错误，现明确为NT。元一致性在72-df-arithmetized-proof给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-order-presentation","status":"resolved","id":"9cc4e14a96f221dc","anchor":"ref-2","